{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "41699656",
      "title": "Implementing a Search Functionality With Help Of Render Props",
      "sourceHash": "91db8f009020fbcf815a6cfb6ba946626fc935a64f11467d6eb9c013e648a552",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 3.69,
          "en": "In this situation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.69,
          "end": 6.03,
          "en": "in this SearchableList component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.03,
          "end": 10.14,
          "en": "this feature of render props allows us to get",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.14,
          "end": 12.15,
          "en": "that concrete rendering logic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.15,
          "end": 15.903,
          "en": "So how something should be rendered out of this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.37,
          "end": 20.61,
          "en": "For that, I'll pull out the special children prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.61,
          "end": 25.47,
          "en": "from the incoming props and I then want to use it down here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.47,
          "end": 27.78,
          "en": "where we render the list items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.78,
          "end": 29.673,
          "en": "So between the list item tag,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.8,
          "end": 35.4,
          "en": "but here I now don't wanna output children like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.4,
          "end": 37.72,
          "en": "but instead, I wanna call it as a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 39.36,
          "end": 41.67,
          "en": "because if I would output it like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.67,
          "end": 44.04,
          "en": "not called as a function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.04,
          "end": 46.5,
          "en": "children would have to be some markup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.5,
          "end": 50.7,
          "en": "which would then be the same with the same text inside of it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.7,
          "end": 52.893,
          "en": "for all list items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.48,
          "end": 57.78,
          "en": "But of course, I want to say markup with different text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 57.78,
          "end": 61.113,
          "en": "inside of it with different text for every item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.07,
          "end": 64.5,
          "en": "Hence children must be some function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.5,
          "end": 68.403,
          "en": "to which I can pass the item so that it's then this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.403,
          "end": 71.07,
          "en": "that will be executed for every item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.07,
          "end": 74.67,
          "en": "and that will then return the concrete JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.67,
          "end": 77.31,
          "en": "that should be rendered for that specific item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 77.31,
          "end": 80.883,
          "en": "in that list item, in that SearchableList component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 82.08,
          "end": 85.35,
          "en": "So the children prop is called as a function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 85.35,
          "end": 87.18,
          "en": "which might look weird,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 87.18,
          "end": 91.8,
          "en": "but which is something you're allowed to do as long",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 91.8,
          "end": 95.19,
          "en": "as the result of that function is something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 95.19,
          "end": 98.37,
          "en": "that can be rendered since you are calling it inside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.37,
          "end": 99.93299999999999,
          "en": "of a JSX snippet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 100.89,
          "end": 103.59,
          "en": "And therefore, we can go to the app component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 103.59,
          "end": 107.463,
          "en": "which is the place where I'm using SearchableList,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 108.33,
          "end": 111.93,
          "en": "and we now should pass something between those opening",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 111.93,
          "end": 113.94,
          "en": "and closing tags.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.94,
          "end": 117.93,
          "en": "Now, for those places, I prepared a special component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 117.93,
          "end": 121.44,
          "en": "which you find attached, a Place.jsx file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 121.44,
          "end": 123.25,
          "en": "which contains a place component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.8,
          "end": 126.72,
          "en": "and you can use that component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 126.72,
          "end": 129.54,
          "en": "for outputting an individual place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 129.54,
          "end": 133.95,
          "en": "To do that, we now have to pass a function as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 133.95,
          "end": 134.88,
          "en": "between the opening",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 134.88,
          "end": 138.04,
          "en": "and closing SearchableList component tags",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 139.14,
          "end": 143.1,
          "en": "because again, children is expected to be a function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 143.1,
          "end": 146.4,
          "en": "It will be a function where we get the item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 146.4,
          "end": 149.4,
          "en": "that is being rendered by a SearchableList",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 149.4,
          "end": 151.95,
          "en": "because that's how we're calling this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 151.95,
          "end": 153.72,
          "en": "inside of SearchableList.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 153.72,
          "end": 155.79,
          "en": "In there we're calling children",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 155.79,
          "end": 158.643,
          "en": "and we're passing item to children.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 159.54,
          "end": 163.47,
          "en": "So we'll get that item here when we create that function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 163.47,
          "end": 167.19,
          "en": "that's passed as a value for the children prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 167.19,
          "end": 171.03,
          "en": "And then here we can return whichever JSX code we want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 171.03,
          "end": 174.543,
          "en": "For example, that place component I just gave you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 175.62,
          "end": 180.62,
          "en": "We can import it from Place.jsx here in the App.jsx file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 181.5,
          "end": 182.97,
          "en": "and then to Place,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 182.97,
          "end": 186.48,
          "en": "you should pass the item prop, which gets that item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 186.48,
          "end": 189.873,
          "en": "that is received from the children function, so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 191.16,
          "end": 195.93,
          "en": "Now, for that other list here with the plain text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 195.93,
          "end": 198.88,
          "en": "we also must pass a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 199.86,
          "end": 201.72,
          "en": "as a value for the children prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 201.72,
          "end": 204.12,
          "en": "And we'll, of course, also get the item here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 204.12,
          "end": 206.88,
          "en": "but here I'm then fine with just outputting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 206.88,
          "end": 211.053,
          "en": "that string value and hence I'll just return item like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 212.52,
          "end": 214.98,
          "en": "And that's this render props pattern.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 214.98,
          "end": 218.07,
          "en": "We're passing a function as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 218.07,
          "end": 221.16,
          "en": "for the children prop in this case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 221.16,
          "end": 222.75,
          "en": "so that the other component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 222.75,
          "end": 226.82999999999998,
          "en": "the receiving component, can use that received function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 226.82999999999998,
          "end": 229.02,
          "en": "which it received through props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 229.02,
          "end": 230.82,
          "en": "to render some content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 230.82,
          "end": 232.923,
          "en": "Hence the name render props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 234.27,
          "end": 236.64,
          "en": "Well, and with that you will see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 236.64,
          "end": 239.46,
          "en": "that now we're rendering the places like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 239.46,
          "end": 242.25,
          "en": "and the other items like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 242.25,
          "end": 245.64,
          "en": "And now it's also clearer that search works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 245.64,
          "end": 247.44,
          "en": "for those places as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 247.44,
          "end": 248.94,
          "en": "You can see that here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 248.94,
          "end": 252.84,
          "en": "We can now search just as we were able to search before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 252.84,
          "end": 256.593,
          "en": "but now we also see something thanks to render props.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}